# ArthaSaar is a STATIC site. Everything the browser needs is in docs/.
#
# The python files are excluded deliberately: requirements.txt at the repo root makes
# Vercel's zero-config detection choose the Python runtime, and it then fails with
#   [PYTHON_ENDPOINT_NOT_FOUND] No python endpoint found
# because there is no serverless function here - docs/index.html is the whole app.
# vercel.json also sets "framework": null, so detection cannot pick Python again.
requirements.txt
requirements-*.txt
pyproject.toml
Pipfile
setup.py
runtime.txt
api/

# pipeline data - hundreds of MB, not part of the site
data/
.github/
reference/
tests/
worker/
*.parquet
*.zip
*.pyc
__pycache__/
scripts/
config/
